# Advanced Error Handling Patterns in TypeScript Applications

## Introduction

Error handling is a critical aspect of any robust application. In TypeScript, effective error handling can make your code more resilient, maintainable, and easier to debug. This article explores advanced error handling patterns that you can employ in your TypeScript applications.

