# Integrating TypeScript with React Query for Efficient State Management

In modern web development, managing state across components can be a complex and error-prone process. React Query, a powerful data-fetching library, simplifies this by providing a reactive state management system. When combined with TypeScript, it offers a robust solution for managing application state with strong type safety. This guide will walk you through integrating TypeScript with React Query, focusing on the benefits and practical implementation.

## Table of Contents

- Introduction to React Query
- TypeScript with React Query: Benefits
