  id: number;
  name: string;
  profile: {
    bio: string;
    address: {
      street: string;
      city: string;
      zipCode: string;
    };
  };
};
```

### Optimization

To mitigate the performance impact of deep type instantiation, Aiko can refactor her code to use interfaces instead of nested types:

```typescript
