## Bundle Size

The size of the JavaScript bundle generated by TypeScript can significantly impact the performance of your application, especially on mobile devices.

### Real-World Scenario

Raj, a developer at Mobile Solutions, is working on an e-commerce application that targets both desktop and mobile users. He has noticed that the mobile version of the application loads slowly, which is affecting user experience.

### Code Example

