| Remove Event Listeners   | Ensure that event listeners are removed when they are no longer needed.       | `button.addEventListener('click', function() { ... }).removeEventListener('click', this);` |
| WeakMaps/WeakSets        | Use WeakMaps and WeakSets to store objects that can be garbage collected.     | `const weakMap = new WeakMap(); const obj = { value: 'I am weakly referenced' }; weakMap.set(obj, 'some value');` |
| Optimize Data Structures | Use efficient data structures to minimize memory usage.                       | Choose the right data structure based on the use case.                     |

