| Performance | Improved | Improved |

## Lessons Learned

1. **Microtasks can cause the event loop to be blocked, leading to performance issues. Using Promise.allSettled can help manage multiple asynchronous operations efficiently.**
2. **Nested callbacks can make the code difficult to read and maintain. Refactoring to use async/await can improve readability and maintainability.**
3. **Regular profiling and monitoring of the application can help identify bottlenecks and areas for optimization.**

