### Key Design Patterns in OpenClaw

| Pattern | Implementation |
|---------|-----------------|
| **Consecutive failure threshold** | 2 consecutive failures before restart (avoids false positives) |
| **State persistence** | JSON state file survives restarts |
| **Backoff on recovery** | Wait 10s after restart before rechecking |
| **Scheduler liveness** | Check for task activity, not just process existence |
| **Anti-idle** | Detect CEO stall and rotate session |
| **Growth analysis** | Periodically analyze strategy performance |
| **Log rotation** | Keep last 5000 lines to prevent disk exhaustion |

