```bash
npm install axios
```

### 2. Make a Request with Error Handling

```typescript
// axios-error-handling.ts
import axios from 'axios';

const fetchData = async () => {
  try {
    const response = await axios.get('https://api.example.com/data');
    console.log(response.data);
  } catch (error) {
