    console.log(data);
  }
});
```

## Azure Cost Management and Billing

Azure Cost Management and Billing is designed to help organizations understand and manage their cloud spending. It provides detailed cost and usage data, along with the ability to set budgets and alerts.

- **Cost Allocation**: Allocate costs across departments, services, or projects.
- **Budgets and Alerts**: Set spending limits and receive notifications when thresholds are exceeded.
- **Detailed Reporting**: Generate reports on costs and usage for financial analysis.

