    console.log('Rows:');
    rows.forEach(row => console.log(row));
  })
  .catch(err => {
    console.error('The API encountered an error:', err);
  });
```

## Comparison Table

Below is a comparison table highlighting the key features of the three cloud cost estimation tools:

| Feature         | AWS Cost Explorer | Azure Cost Management and Billing | Google Cloud Cost Management |
